  "notes": "Warm off-white page with soft pastel tinted bands (mint, cream, peach) and a wavy green gradient behind the press quotes. The signature Todoist red (#e44232) is used for primary CTAs. The hero and final CTA buttons are chunky and 3D-looking, with a lighter lower lip and a glossy diagonal highlight. Each feature section has a colored eyebrow (red 'Clear your mind', teal 'Focus on what's important', green 'Organize your teamwork'). Their right-hand visuals are scroll-driven, so they show up empty in the full-page capture. There are small confetti and sparkle decorations (stars, plus and check circles) near the hero. The handwritten note with a curly arrow points to the video collage. The stats strip is an endless marquee of soft clay-like 3D illustrations with fading edges. The press-quote strip has no codebook entry, so I filed a proposal for 'social-proof-strip'."
